cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FieldRF, please cite the conference paper in preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "FieldRF: Anatomy-Conditioned 3D Rectified Flow for Unified Cross-Field MRI Harmonization"
abstract: >-
  Anatomy-conditioned volumetric rectified flow for within-modality cross-field
  MRI harmonization. One shared model covers T1W, T2W and T2FLAIR across 0.1T,
  1.5T, 3T, 5T and 7T using MAISI latents and Brain-ID anatomy features.
